        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "分金：兼丑未适宜用辛丑辛未；兼寅申适宜用丙寅丙申。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
